section 10;
1[(fa) the transactions under the second proviso to sub-section (2) of section 21;
(fb) the transactions under Explanation I to clause (c) of section 29A;
(fc) the transactions under the second proviso to clause (j) of section 29A;]
2[(fd) the form, particulars, manner and fee for making application before the Adjudicating
